  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tN9mu6M.png\" width=\"1100\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與傳奇生物成為朋友，陪伴你走遍世界！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge Beta 版！</strong></span> <br><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZNMECpNpE9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/866521661880795147/866526566837387285/Discord1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"58\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chirpycricket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/866521661880795147/866887556657709076/Patreon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"58\"></a></p><h4><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;color:#f90\">最新消息與公告！<br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">六月更新：</span></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge 版 Beta 版本發布！<br></span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增 14 種可馴服的動物，分散在世界各地的不同生態域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含飛行、水生和陸地坐騎。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每種坐騎都可裝備盔甲和額外的物品欄。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可愛的寶寶變體！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自訂的設定檔，用於調整生成設定、坐騎屬性、實體 AI/行為等。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>重要提醒：</strong>這個模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/4096661\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib 3.1.38</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli/files/4031402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli 19.2-77</a>（Forge 版）。</span></p><h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>支援的模組加載器：</strong> </span></h4><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><u>模組功能：</u></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><u>互動：</u></strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>馴服：</strong>用空手左鍵點擊坐騎，反覆騎乘直到牠們不再甩落玩家，即可馴服。類似於馬匹，可能需要嘗試幾次才能成功馴服。小心！有些坐騎具有敵意，會在馴服過程中反擊！</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>騎乘坐騎：</strong>用空手左鍵點擊已馴服的坐騎即可騎乘，並用鞍控制。飛行坐騎可重複按下跳躍鍵來爬升高度，或在飛行時透過視角控制來瞄準。水生坐騎同樣可以在水下使用跳躍鍵獲得「游泳加速」。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>指令坐騎停留/坐下：</strong>已馴服的坐騎會自然在主人最後下馬的地方附近徘徊。若想讓坐騎留在某個精確位置不走開，用木棍右鍵點擊牠們，即可讓牠們坐下。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁衍坐騎：</strong>若滿足以下條件，兩隻同種坐騎可以繁殖：雙方都必須是<u>已馴服</u>狀態；雙方都必須擁有<u>滿血</u>；且雙方都必須被給予正確的<u>繁殖物品</u>。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>迷你坐騎：</strong>若在幼年坐騎長大前餵食扭曲蕈，牠會長成迷你坐騎。這些坐騎<u>無法</u>被正常體型的玩家騎乘，但其他方面與大型坐騎相同。在幼年坐騎長大前餵食緋紅蕈可以解除迷你效果。<br></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>撫摸坐騎：</strong>潛行時用空手右鍵點擊已馴服的坐騎，即可撫摸牠們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><u>裝備：</u></strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>增加/移除物品欄：</strong>坐騎可裝備箱子來增加裝備畫面中的額外物品欄，並可用剪刀卸下箱子。不同種類的坐騎總物品欄容量不同，必要時可在設定檔中調整。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>開啟坐騎物品欄：</strong>潛行時用空手雙擊右鍵點擊已馴服的坐騎，即可開啟坐騎物品欄。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>坐騎盔甲：</strong>可在物品欄畫面中為已馴服的坐騎裝備/卸下馬鎧。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>召喚杖：</strong>可用來將坐騎傳送一段短距離。用召喚杖右鍵點擊坐騎以連結，再次使用即可召喚。（坐騎必須位於已載入的區塊中，且必須有足夠空間讓牠們傳送進來）</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PyTC1gR.png\" alt=\"召喚杖合成配方\" width=\"317\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><u>其他行為：</u></strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>戰鬥坐騎：</strong>戰鬥坐騎會在戰鬥中協助主人。此行為可在設定檔中啟用/停用。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>坐騎攻擊性：</strong>有些坐騎天生對玩家和/或其他生物具有敵意。一旦馴服，這些坐騎除非主人命令，否則不會再攻擊其他實體。坐騎的攻擊性/AI可在設定檔中調整。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eDvbp4B.png\" width=\"1100\"></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>Żar-ptak：</strong></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>稀有度：</strong>普通</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>棲息地：</strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村莊<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>飲食：</strong>草食</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"><br></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>行為：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 非敵對</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁殖物品：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金蘋果<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\">_</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設屬性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;生命：20</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;攻擊：3</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;物品欄：9</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;會保護主人：是</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>感謝 @Le flémmard！</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>\n<p>_________________________________________</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XxWcV9u.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"582\"></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>Acencia：</strong></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>稀有度：</strong>普通 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>棲息地：</strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">森林；雪地針葉林；<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雪地針葉林丘陵；<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雪地針葉林山地；</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飲食：</strong>肉食</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"><br></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>行為：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 非敵對</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可攀爬垂直表面</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 會獵捕羊、山羊、<br>兔子和雞</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁殖物品：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">羊肉；鮭魚；</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\">_</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設屬性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;生命：28</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;攻擊：10</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;物品欄：12</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;會保護主人：是</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>\n<p>_________________________________________</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NRD4HpV.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"582\"></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>Archelon：</strong></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>稀有度：</strong>普通 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>棲息地：</strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">深海溫海洋</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飲食：</strong>雜食</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"><br></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>行為：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 非敵對</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁殖物品：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">熱帶魚；河豚；</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\">_</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設屬性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;生命：60</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;攻擊：6</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;物品欄：54</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;會保護主人：否</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>\n<p>_________________________________________</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8vpp0nZ.png\" width=\"1100\"></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>Colelytra：</strong></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>稀有度：</strong>普通 </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>棲息地：</strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇地<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>飲食：</strong>草食</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"><br></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>行為：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 非敵對</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>繁殖物品：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紅色蘑菇；<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">棕色蘑菇；<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">花卉物品；糖；</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\">_</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設屬性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;生命：14</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;攻擊：2</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;物品欄：15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;會保護主人：否</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>感謝 @Atlan！</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>_________________________________________</td>\n<td>\n<p>_________________________________________</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LNlbyOh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"582\"></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>信鴿：</strong></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>稀有度：</strong>常見</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>棲息地：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">叢林；叢林丘陵；叢林邊緣；</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飲食：</strong>草食性</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"><br></sp